  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Cold On The Shoulder**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **Riding Out The Winter**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Lonesome Moonlight Waltz**: back after 112 archived shows (448 days); rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2020-02-23.dpa4011** (recommended): source not stated; 16 songs; 92 min; rated 4/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Reviewer attended all three nights of WinterWonderGrass in Steamboat and loves the festival [2]\n- Reviewer says the band's jamming is the fastest and most precise they have ever heard [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2020-02-23.dpa4011**: taped by Rob O'Brien; transferred by Rob O'Brien; source: DPA 4011(DIN) > Edirol R-44[Oade Concert Mod](24/96) [1]. Also: Recorded with DPA 4011 microphones through a DIN connection into an Edirol R-44 (modified by Oade) at 24-bit/96kHz [1]",
